  "$comment": "Cross-end same-key copy map for scripts/l10n-cross-end-check.mjs. Keys are matched by replacing '.' with '_' (iOS dotted, Android underscored, Web nested JSON). Asymmetric names go in rules ({var} patterns) or pairs. iOS is the reference end. Every exemption needs a reason; an exemption that no longer matches a difference fails the gate. unpairedBudget locks how many in-scope keys exist on one end only (ratchet: above fails, below asks to tighten).",
